# Build-time artifacts, regenerated by GridBridge_claude/build_grid_hirep_claude.sh:
#   libGrid.a, Config.h  -- captured out of the built Grid
#   *.o                  -- compiled bridge objects
#   grid_flags_claude.txt-- recorded grid-config flags
# Do NOT commit these (libGrid.a alone is ~53 MB, over GitHub's 50 MB limit). Only the
# sources in ../GridBridge_claude are versioned; rebuild to regenerate these.
libGrid.a
Config.h
*.o
grid_flags_claude.txt
